msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:133
#: 41cc905f42b6468c86ff7fff73dd0ff6
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage sensor and  current sensor. The voltage sensor can handle up to 8S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

